    {
      "source": "Variant of <a href=\"#setBody(org.springframework.http.StreamingHttpOutputMessage.Body)\"><code>setBody(Body)</code></a> for a non-streaming write.",
      "translation": "适用于非流式写入的 `<a href=\"#setBody(org.springframework.http.StreamingHttpOutputMessage.Body)\"><code>setBody(Body)</code></a>` 变体。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#setBody(org.springframework.http.StreamingHttpOutputMessage.Body)\"><code>setBody(Body)</code></a> method provides the option to stream, and is\nmutually exclusive use of <a href=\"HttpOutputMessage.html#getBody()\"><code>HttpOutputMessage.getBody()</code></a>, which instead returns an\n<code>OutputStream</code> that aggregates the request body before sending it.",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"#setBody(org.springframework.http.StreamingHttpOutputMessage.Body)\"><code>setBody(Body)</code></a>` 方法提供了流式传输的选项，且与 `<a href=\"HttpOutputMessage.html#getBody()\"><code>HttpOutputMessage.getBody()</code></a>` 互斥使用；后者返回一个在发送请求体之前聚合请求体的 `<code>OutputStream</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that this is mutually exclusive with <a href=\"HttpOutputMessage.html#getBody()\"><code>HttpOutputMessage.getBody()</code></a>, which\nmay instead aggregate the request body before sending it.",
      "translation": "注意，这与<a href=\"HttpOutputMessage.html#getBody()\"><code>HttpOutputMessage.getBody()</code></a>互斥，后者可能会在发送之前聚合请求体。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>body</code> - the streaming body callback",
      "translation": "<code>body</code> - 流式传输体回调",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>body</code> - the content to write",
      "translation": "`body` - 要写入的内容",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Contract to stream request body content to an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/OutputStream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>OutputStream</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将请求体内容流式传输到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/OutputStream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>OutputStream</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the streaming body callback for this message.",
      "translation": "为此消息设置流式传输主体回调。",
